      "name": "dormanie",
      "created_at": "2025-08-01T18:28:18.338Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the Frappe Framework, I’ve enabled <code>developer_mode</code> in <code>site_config.json</code>, and according to the documentation, any changes to a DocType should be saved automatically as a JSON file inside the app’s folder. However, when I create or modify a DocType, the JSON file isn’t generated.</p>\n<p>What could be causing this? Is there anything else I need to configure besides enabling <code>developer_mode</code>?</p>",
