      "created_at": "2025-08-01T19:46:07.395Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Suppose you did some Changes in Employee doctype by using edit doctype method then it will generate json in ERPNEXT app , but if you are using Customize form method then you have to do either Export Customization frm UI or from code editor export-fictures to generate json . <strong>Can you explain which method you are using</strong> ,also check git status of respective app in code editor  <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/dormant\">@dormant</a></p>",
